    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client concerns, our proposed solution will leverage our existing capabilities in digital sobriety practices. our will implement measures such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours." ;
