        ex:hasText "To further reduce the environmental footprint of our proposed solution, our will ensure that our e-waste is managed responsibly through our partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling provider in France. our goal is to achieve an average energy reduction of 35% compared to our baseline, which aligns with the client's objective to reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
