        ex:hasText "Given the requirements and constraints from the knowledge graph, including the need for an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily missions, improve efficiency of administrative services, and ensure quality of service rendered to users, as well as constraints related to data sovereignty, security, and environmental footprint, what is our overall strategy for responding to this tender, and how will our prioritize these requirements and constraints in our proposal?" ;
