        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, you propose a hybrid cloud architecture that leverages you experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), all of which are the European Union-based and compliant with GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach will enable you to ensure data sovereignty while hosting The solution exclusively within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, you can utilize you expertise in API integration, specifically using REST, GraphQL, or SOAP (legacy) standards. you can also employ API gateways such as Kong or Apigee to manage and secure the interactions between The solution and the various business softwares, civil status, town planning, EDM, and user directories." ;
