        ex:hasText "For scalability, you will design the architecture to be containerized using Docker and orchestrated with Kubernetes (K8s), allowing for efficient resource allocation and automatic scaling. you experience with Terraform and Ansible as IaC tools will help you manage and provision the infrastructure efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

