        ex:hasText "To ensure security, you will implement a zero-trust network architecture, utilizing VLAN segmentation, mTLS between services, and secrets management using HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk Conjur. you will also comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR by implementing AES-256 encryption at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit." ;
