        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR and other regulatory requirements, you will conduct thorough risk assessments and implement necessary measures to guarantee the protection of personal data. you experience with explainability tools such as SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation will help you provide transparent and accountable AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

